al if you want to beat these levels while going at breakneck speeds!<br></li><li> <strong>Tons of Levels</strong> - SINGUALRIUM has 20+ handcrafted levels, with more to come!<br></li><li> <strong>In-game Leaderboards - compare your times with the best of the best!<br></strong></li><li> <strong>Level Editor</strong> - Create and share your own custom levels!<br></li><li> <strong>Complex Movement System</strong> - combining wallrunning, walljumping, swinging, and bunny hopping will allow you to zoom through the levels<br></li><li> <strong>Builtin Level Timers</strong> - Compare your level times with your friends!</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624410/extras/d1141e53ceb1a7e0c622badb392783b0.poster.avif?t=1712556039\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624410/extras/d1141e53ceb1a7e0c622badb392783b0.webm?t=1712556039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624410/extras/d1141e53ceb1a7e0c622badb392783b0.mp4?t=1712556039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
